// Title: Potential Waveedit.DLL Sideloading
// Sigma ID: 71b31e99-9ad0-47d4-aeb5-c0ca3928eeeb
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-06-14 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: persistence, privilege-escalation, execution, stealth, T1574.001
// Description: Detects potential DLL sideloading of "waveedit.dll", which is part of the Nero WaveEditor audio
//   editing software.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/23/f/behind-the-scenes-unveiling-the-hidden-workings-of-earth-preta.html
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_waveedit.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\waveedit.dll" and (not(((InitiatingProcessFolderPath in~ ("C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Nero\\Nero Apps\\Nero WaveEditor\\waveedit.exe", "C:\\Program Files\\Nero\\Nero Apps\\Nero WaveEditor\\waveedit.exe")) and (FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Nero\\Nero Apps\\Nero WaveEditor\\" or FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files\\Nero\\Nero Apps\\Nero WaveEditor\\"))))
